OL,3,GNEWSAPark bridge repairs to start as
OL,4,Aclosures remain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said it aims to start
OL,7,Frepair work on a long-closed city park
OL,8,Fbridge later this year.
OL,10,FThree of the 15 bridges in Jesmond
OL,11,FDene, in Newcastle, were closed over
OL,12,Fsafety concerns.
OL,14,FWhile bridges at Cherry Tree Walk and
OL,15,FDene Terrace closed in early 2025, the
OL,16,Fcrossing at Coleman's Field was closed
OL,17,Fin early 2024.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
