OL,3,GNEWSAPark bridge repairs to start as
OL,4,Aclosures remain
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member for local services and
OL,7,Fneighbourhoods at Newcastle City
OL,8,FCouncil, Peter Lovatt, said he hoped
OL,9,Frepair work to the Coleman's Field
OL,10,Fbridge would begin soon, but work was
OL,11,Fongoing to assess "the best options"
OL,12,Ffor the other two closed bridges.
